---
/**
 * Swarm 的三层结构：顶层 Coordinator 对接用户，中层共享留言板落盘，
 * 底层三类消费者（Worker、系统观测 Worker、只读 Sidecar 看板）各自独立运行。
 * 宽屏三列，窄屏改单列；动效沿用常驻 Agent 那篇，没有 JS / 打印 / 减少动效时直接以终态展示。
 */
import '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/figures.css'

import RevealBoot from '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/RevealBoot.astro'

const bottomNodes = [
  {
    kicker: '执行层',
    title: 'Workers（工作节点）',
    badge: '@mention 唤醒',
    items: [
      '每个 Worker 都是独立会话与独立上下文',
      '休眠挂在板上不烧 token，被点名才醒',
      '改代码时走 share / branch 独立工作区'
    ]
  },
  {
    kicker: '观测层',
    title: 'Monitor 与 Narrator',
    badge: '系统 Worker',
    items: [
      'Monitor 定时巡检僵局，发 @coordinator [stall]',
      'Narrator 把留言板提炼成 view.json / view.html',
      '两者都不参与业务代码，也不接普通任务'
    ]
  },
  {
    kicker: '展示层',
    title: 'swarm_board Sidecar',
    badge: '只读进程',
    items: [
      '按 mtime/size/inode 缓存只读监听磁盘文件',
      '不写任何状态，也不直接给 Agent 发消息',
      '渲染右侧看板：总览、消息流与 @mention 图谱'
    ]
  }
]
---

<figure class='aoa-fig swm-arch not-prose' data-swm-arch>
  <figcaption class='aoa-cap'>
    <strong>图 2 · Antigravity Swarm 的三层结构。</strong>
    Coordinator 和所有 Worker 靠磁盘上的共享留言板配合；右侧看板只负责读文件画界面，不参与调度。
  </figcaption>

  <div class='swm-arch-stack'>
    <div class='swm-arch-top aoa-rv' style='--i: 0'>
      <div class='aoa-card aoa-card-soft swm-user'>
        <p class='aoa-kicker'>唯一入口</p>
        <p class='aoa-title'>用户</p>
        <p class='aoa-sub'>只和 Coordinator 对话</p>
      </div>
      <span class='swm-link-h' aria-hidden='true'>↔</span>
      <div class='aoa-card aoa-card-accent swm-coord'>
        <p class='aoa-kicker'>调度层 · 主会话</p>
        <p class='aoa-title'>Coordinator（协调者）</p>
        <p class='aoa-sub'>拆任务、派活、验收、对人汇报；自己不写代码，不跑长命令。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='swm-connector aoa-rv' style='--i: 1' aria-hidden='true'>
      <span class='swm-connector-line'></span>
      <span class='swm-connector-pill'>swarm / post_message / read_board / swarm_wait</span>
      <span class='swm-connector-line'></span>
    </div>

    <div class='aoa-card aoa-card-accent swm-board aoa-rv' style='--i: 2'>
      <div class='swm-board-head'>
        <p class='aoa-kicker'>持久化枢纽</p>
        <code class='swm-path'>.system_generated/swarm/</code>
      </div>
      <p class='aoa-title'>共享留言板（Shared Message Board）</p>
      <div class='swm-board-files'>
        <div class='swm-file-box'>
          <p class='swm-file-name'><code>board.jsonl</code></p>
          <p class='aoa-sub'>
            只追加的有序消息流，每条带递增序号 <code>#seq</code>，交接靠引用序号而非复制全文。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class='swm-file-box'>
          <p class='swm-file-name'><code>members.json</code></p>
          <p class='aoa-sub'>
            花名册：记录每个 Worker 的名字、角色、<code>conversation_id</code>、频道与工作区。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='swm-branch-bar aoa-rv' style='--i: 3' aria-hidden='true'>
      <span class='swm-branch-stem'></span>
      <span class='swm-branch-fork'>
        <span class='swm-branch-drop'></span>
        <span class='swm-branch-drop'></span>
        <span class='swm-branch-drop'></span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class='swm-bottom-grid' role='list'>
      {
        bottomNodes.map((node, i) => (
          <div class='aoa-card swm-node aoa-rv' style={`--i: ${i + 4}`} role='listitem'>
            <div class='swm-node-top'>
              <p class='aoa-kicker'>{node.kicker}</p>
              <span class='swm-badge'>{node.badge}</span>
            </div>
            <p class='aoa-title'>{node.title}</p>
            <ul class='aoa-list'>
              {node.items.map((item) => (
                <li>{item}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class='aoa-note'>
    示意图。青色边框是调度主线（Coordinator
    和共享留言板）；下方三栏彼此独立，右侧看板就算重启也不会影响 Swarm 继续跑。
  </p>
  <p class='aoa-sr'>
    顶层用户只与 Coordinator 对话；Coordinator 通过 swarm、post_message、read_board、swarm_wait
    四个工具读写中层的共享留言板，包含 board.jsonl 和 members.json 两个文件；底层分为三栏：按
    @mention 唤醒的 Workers，负责防卡死和总览的 Monitor 与 Narrator，以及只读监听磁盘渲染右侧看板的
    swarm_board Sidecar。
  </p>
  <RevealBoot />
</figure>

<script>
  import { armReveal } from '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/reveal'

  armReveal('[data-swm-arch]', undefined, 0.2)
</script>

<style>
  .swm-arch {
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .swm-arch-stack {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .swm-arch-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(120px, 0.34fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .swm-user,
  .swm-coord,
  .swm-board,
  .swm-node {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .swm-link-h {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: hsl(var(--primary));
  }

  .swm-connector {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin: 6px 0;
  }

  .swm-connector-line {
    width: 2px;
    height: 12px;
    background: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.75);
  }

  .swm-connector-pill {
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: hsl(var(--muted) / 0.6);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.85);
    text-align: center;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .swm-board-head,
  .swm-node-top {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .swm-board-head .aoa-kicker,
  .swm-node-top .aoa-kicker {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .swm-path,
  .swm-badge {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .swm-badge {
    padding: 1px 7px;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: hsl(var(--background));
  }

  .swm-board-files {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .swm-file-box {
    padding: 9px 11px;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: hsl(var(--background) / 0.85);
  }

  .swm-file-name {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .swm-file-box code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
  }

  .swm-branch-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 4px 0 6px;
  }

  .swm-branch-stem {
    width: 2px;
    height: 12px;
    background: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.75);
  }

  .swm-branch-fork {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    height: 12px;
  }

  .swm-branch-fork::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: calc(100% / 6);
    right: calc(100% / 6);
    height: 2px;
    background: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.75);
  }

  .swm-branch-drop {
    justify-self: center;
    width: 2px;
    height: 12px;
    background: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.75);
  }

  .swm-bottom-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .swm-node .aoa-list {
    font-size: 0.77rem;
  }

  :global(.dark) .swm-coord,
  :global(.dark) .swm-board {
    border-color: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.78);
    background: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.12);
  }

  :global(.dark) .swm-file-box {
    background: hsl(var(--background) / 0.55);
  }

  :global(.dark) .swm-connector-pill,
  :global(.dark) .swm-badge {
    background: hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.06);
  }

  @container (max-width: 660px) {
    .swm-arch-top {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .swm-link-h {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }

    .swm-board-files,
    .swm-bottom-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .swm-branch-fork {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
